(7698660, 1263094, 3306, '<td valign="top">Super capture with the R5! That focus tracking is amazing! Congrats on the Blue.</td>', 'Super capture with the R5! That focus tracking is amazing! Congrats on the Blue.', '2021-08-08 06:59:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7698661, 1263207, 156466, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM. You were in my top three, and while I suspect this photo''s "homage to Ansel" took into account his zone system (something I believe works far better applied to color than B&amp;W), I believe a treatment that brought some of the blacks to full black while also boosting some of the shadow detail would have made it my #1 as it''s a very well executed exposure.</td>', 'Congrats on the HM. You were in my top three, and while I suspect this photo''s "homage to Ansel" took into account his zone system (something I believe works far better applied to color than B&W), I believe a treatment that brought some of the blacks to full black while also boosting some of the shadow detail would have made it my #1 as it''s a very well executed exposure.', '2021-08-08 07:08:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7698662, 1263174, 156466, '<td valign="top">Congrats and lovely capture, it was in my top 2. Curious, trigger or got lucky? You wouldn''t lose points for the first. Ever since I bought a trigger 4 years ago we''ve barely got a decent thunderstorm. LOL</td>', 'Congrats and lovely capture, it was in my top 2. Curious, trigger or got lucky? You wouldn''t lose points for the first. Ever since I bought a trigger 4 years ago we''ve barely got a decent thunderstorm. LOL', '2021-08-08 07:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7698663, 1263188, 156466, '<td valign="top">In my top two. Really nicely exposed and processed. It would have been easy to overdo this one so you got bonus points. :)</td>', 'In my top two. Really nicely exposed and processed. It would have been easy to overdo this one so you got bonus points. :)', '2021-08-08 07:25:31.000000', NULL, 0),
