(7698763, 1263138, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is a superb capture and a wonderful shot, I just wasn''t crazy about the processing steps in trying to lighten the egret. It seems like the lightening was done on such a small area -- the egret and a little around it, that it looked artificial. I''ve had this problem quite a bit. It would be interesting to see the original and see if there were better options. It is beautiful, and I gave it a 7, but it seems like the processing just wasn''t up to the incredible capture -- which happens to me all the time! Well seen and grabbed!</td>', 'This is a superb capture and a wonderful shot, I just wasn''t crazy about the processing steps in trying to lighten the egret. It seems like the lightening was done on such a small area -- the egret and a little around it, that it looked artificial. I''ve had this problem quite a bit. It would be interesting to see the original and see if there were better options. It is beautiful, and I gave it a 7, but it seems like the processing just wasn''t up to the incredible capture -- which happens to me all the time! Well seen and grabbed!', '2021-08-09 12:42:18.000000', NULL, 0),
